      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "最近经常听到这类发言。\n成田白仁的跑法强劲，\n似乎开始出现对此感到畏惧的人。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9bae8ce8fec10abd865340d32421c08b8435275dc1f2071e1425959f96dd110c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
