      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "强烈的光芒对比出昏暗的阴影。尽管如此，\n我想这在胜负的世界里是在所难免的──",
      "source_fingerprint": "fd2f889b4c1c21d63bb4ab2c4edc4285d75fbf0bfc5462bacd3ab7a71df9d8c3",
